(1, 1, 1, '<p>A shopkeeper marks an item 25% above cost and gives a 10% discount. What is the profit percentage?</p>', '[{\"id\":\"a\",\"text\":\"10%\"},{\"id\":\"b\",\"text\":\"12.5%\"},{\"id\":\"c\",\"text\":\"15%\"},{\"id\":\"d\",\"text\":\"20%\"}]', 'b', 3.00, '<p>The correct answer is <strong>12.5%</strong>.</p>', 0, '2026-10-28 21:09:18', '2026-10-28 21:09:18', 'single_choice', NULL, '[\"b\"]', NULL, '[]'),
