(96, 12, 24, '<p>A sum doubles in 5 years at simple interest. What is the annual rate?</p>', '[{\"id\":\"a\",\"text\":\"10%\"},{\"id\":\"b\",\"text\":\"15%\"},{\"id\":\"c\",\"text\":\"20%\"},{\"id\":\"d\",\"text\":\"25%\"}]', 'c', 3.00, '<p>The correct answer is <strong>20%</strong>.</p>', 3, '2026-10-28 21:09:23', '2026-10-28 21:09:23', 'single_choice', NULL, '[\"c\"]', NULL, '[]');
